Omissis is released under two licences.

1. The code and the documentation: everything in this repository that part 2
   does not name. MIT License, below.

2. The synthetic data and the results: the files under data/ and results/.
   Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0):
   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
   Full text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode
   Attribution: "Omissis synthetic emails, by the Omissis authors".

The models and the libraries that Omissis calls are not in this repository
and keep their own licences, which are listed in docs/cards.md. Two of them
do not allow commercial use: the classifier of detector D2 (CC BY-NC-ND 4.0)
and the spaCy model of detector D1 (CC BY-NC-SA 3.0).

